  "notes": "Label = nRF52832 port name (P0.xx / P0_xx as printed per image). Image 1 prints \"GIPO0_EXT\" (typo kept). Image 3: PWM cells included as functions; BQ25120AYFPR pin names (IN, TS, BAT) connected to VIN_BQ25120/NTC/VBAT included as functions; IN/OUT power icons and D icons omitted; VDDIO_EXT note (\"To power the Nicla Sense ME using VDDIO_EXT, disable the LS/LDO pin of BQ25120AYFPR\") not included. Image 4: SAMD11 (PA31/PA30) and BHI260AP (JTAG CLK/DIO) names on bottom debug pads; the interleaved header holes in the bottom view are unlabeled and not transcribed. Image 5 (Test Points) shows only scattered labeled test points (BHI INT, BMP SCLK/SDI/SDO/CS, BME CS, FLASH CLK/D0-D3/CS, +3V3, USB D_P/D_N) with no row structure; not transcribed as connectors."
